---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow reveal">Field notes from Japan</p>
    <h1 class="reveal">Japan,<br>without the guesswork.</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy reveal">
      Independent guides to shopping Japan's marketplaces and traveling its
      quiet corners — researched from inside Japan, checked against current
      primary sources, and recalculated when fees change.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="guides-section" id="guides">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-index reveal">Latest guides</div>
    {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
    <div class="guide-row reveal">
      <span class="guide-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="principles-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-index reveal" style="border-top: 0;">Why trust us</div>
    <div class="principles">
      <div class="principle reveal">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Primary sources, visible math</h3>
        <p>We compare official fee tables, help pages, and calculator results, then show our assumptions and the date checked. When something cannot be verified, we say so.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle reveal">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Written from Japan</h3>
        <p>We read the Japanese listings, the domestic forums, and the fine print — the primary sources that vendor blogs skip.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principle reveal">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Criticism stays in</h3>
        <p>Affiliate links never edit our verdicts. When a service we earn nothing from is the right answer, that's the answer we print.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
